+<!doctype html>
+<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
+<title>Privacy Policy — The Athlete Market</title>
+<style>body{font:16px/1.6 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,sans-serif;color:#101828;background:#fff;max-width:720px;margin:0 auto;padding:32px 16px}h1{font-size:28px}h2{font-size:19px;margin-top:28px}a{color:inherit}</style>
+</head><body>
+<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
+<p>Last updated: [DATE]</p>
+<p>The Athlete Market ("we," "us") provides college recruiting consulting to families of high school athletes. This policy explains what we collect and how we use it.</p>
+<h2>What we collect</h2>
+<p>When you submit our application, we collect the parent's name, email, and phone number; the athlete's name, sport, graduation year, school, location, academic and athletic details you provide; and basic technical data (such as IP address, browser, and the ad or link that brought you to our site).</p>
+<h2>How we use it</h2>
+<p>We use your information to review your application, contact you about it (by phone, email, or text message if you opted in), schedule consultations, and improve our advertising and website.</p>
+<h2>Text messaging</h2>
+<p>If you check the SMS consent box, we will text you about your recruiting application, including scheduling and follow-up messages. Message frequency varies (up to 4 messages per inquiry). Message and data rates may apply. Reply STOP to opt out at any time, or HELP for help.</p>
+<p><strong>No mobile information will be shared with third parties or affiliates for marketing or promotional purposes. Text messaging originator opt-in data and consent will not be shared with any third parties.</strong> We share information only with service providers that help us operate (for example, our texting, scheduling, and hosting providers) and only to provide our service to you.</p>
+<h2>We never sell your information</h2>
+<p>We do not sell or rent your personal information.</p>
+<h2>Your choices</h2>
+<p>You can ask us to access, correct, or delete your information, or stop contacting you, by emailing [CONTACT EMAIL].</p>
+<h2>Contact</h2>
+<p>The Athlete Market · [CONTACT EMAIL] · [BUSINESS ADDRESS]</p>
+</body></html>
