+<!doctype html>
+<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
+<title>Terms — The Athlete Market</title>
+<style>body{font:16px/1.6 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,sans-serif;color:#101828;background:#fff;max-width:720px;margin:0 auto;padding:32px 16px}h1{font-size:28px}h2{font-size:19px;margin-top:28px}a{color:inherit}</style>
+</head><body>
+<h1>Terms</h1>
+<p>Last updated: [DATE]</p>
+<h2>SMS program terms</h2>
+<p><strong>Program:</strong> The Athlete Market recruiting application updates. When you opt in on our application form, Chase from The Athlete Market will text you about your application, including a link to schedule a call and follow-up messages.</p>
+<p><strong>Frequency:</strong> Message frequency varies; up to 4 messages per inquiry.</p>
+<p><strong>Cost:</strong> Message and data rates may apply.</p>
+<p><strong>Opt out:</strong> Reply STOP at any time to stop receiving texts. You will receive one confirmation message and no further texts.</p>
+<p><strong>Help:</strong> Reply HELP for help, or email [CONTACT EMAIL].</p>
+<p>Consent to receive text messages is not a condition of purchase. Carriers are not liable for delayed or undelivered messages.</p>
+<p>See our <a href="/privacy.html">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
+<h2>Our services</h2>
+<p>The Athlete Market provides recruiting guidance and consulting. We do not guarantee scholarships, roster spots, admission, or any specific recruiting outcome.</p>
+</body></html>
